# The Registry-DLL Nexus

**CYBR 4450 - Malware Analysis - Spring 2026**

## Project Overview
Proof-of-concept demonstrating Windows Registry persistence
and DLL injection techniques (AppInit_DLLs, Run Keys) with
full Blue Team detection instrumentation (Sysmon, Procmon, Autoruns).

## Team
- Justin Brueggemann
- Mason Wagner

## Structure
- `src` - DLL source code (C++)
- `configs` - Sysmon XML configuration
- `evidence` - Screenshots, logs, Procmon exports
- `docs` - Report and presentation files
- `scripts` - Automation scripts

## MITRE ATT&CK Techniques
- T1546.010 - Event Triggered Execution: AppInit DLLs
- T1547.001 - Boot/Logon Autostart: Registry Run Keys
- T1574.001 - Hijack Execution Flow: DLL Search Order Hijacking
- T1112 - Modify Registry
